<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch economic indicators week of Dec 9.</title>
<headline>Dutch economic indicators week of Dec 9.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said it planned to publish the following key Dutch economic indicators this week.</p>
<p>GMT----date----indicator------------period---previous</p>
<p>    0830  10/12    Producer prices(PPI) Oct	+0.9 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>    0830  13/12    Manufacturing sales  Oct	+6.0 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>    0830  13/12    Retail sales	   Oct	-2.1 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
